"CaseEnricher — merge an archivist's enrichment output into an existing
 'case' tuple WITHOUT clobbering the deterministic skeleton fields that
 CaseBuilder produced.

 The deterministic skeleton (written earlier by CaseBuilder + the engine
 wiring) carries these fields and they MUST survive enrichment untouched:
   workflow_instance, terminal_state, duration_minutes, retries,
   review_cycles, human_interventions, files_changed, actions, repo,
   mission_type, created_at.

 Enrichment is purely ADDITIVE. applyEnrichment: only ever sets four new
 keys (aar, lessons, confidence, enriched_at) and UNIONs the supplied
 tags into the case's existing tags. No deterministic key is read,
 rewritten, or removed.

 ENRICHMENT PAYLOAD (a Maggie Dictionary the archivist produces):
   'aar'        -> String narrative (default '').
   'lessons'    -> Array of String (default empty Array).
   'confidence' -> Number (default 0).
   'tags'       -> Array of String UNIONed with the case's existing
                   deterministic tags (default empty Array).

 mergeTags:with: is a PURE helper (no BBS, no clock): order-stable
 union with de-duplication, unit-testable in isolation."

CaseEnricher subclass: Object

  classMethod: applyEnrichment: enrichment toCaseWithInstance: instanceId scope: scope bbs: bbs [
    "Guarded, additive merge of enrichment into the case tuple for
     instanceId. Returns false (no-op) if no such case exists; otherwise
     mutates the case payload in place and returns true."
    | existing |
    existing := bbs rdp: 'case' scope: scope identity: instanceId.
    existing isNil ifTrue: [^false].

    "update: (linear) — the case is a durable LINEAR tuple (see
     WorkflowEngine>>writeCaseSkeleton and BBS>>isDurableCategory). update:
     consumes + re-writes it and, because 'case' is durable, re-flushes so
     the enrichment survives a restart."
    bbs update: 'case' scope: scope identity: instanceId do: [:p |
      p at: 'aar' put: (enrichment at: 'aar' ifAbsent: ['']).
      p at: 'lessons' put: (enrichment at: 'lessons' ifAbsent: [Array new: 0]).
      p at: 'confidence' put: (enrichment at: 'confidence' ifAbsent: [0]).
      p at: 'enriched_at' put: (DateTime now epochSeconds).
      p at: 'tags' put: (CaseEnricher
        mergeTags: (p at: 'tags' ifAbsent: [Array new: 0])
        with: (enrichment at: 'tags' ifAbsent: [Array new: 0]))
    ].
    ^true
  ]

  classMethod: mergeTags: existingTags with: newTags [
    "PURE order-stable union with de-duplication. Existing tags keep their
     order and precedence; new tags are appended only when not already
     present. nil inputs are treated as empty. No BBS, no clock."
    | merged ex nw |
    ex := existingTags isNil ifTrue: [Array new: 0] ifFalse: [existingTags].
    nw := newTags isNil ifTrue: [Array new: 0] ifFalse: [newTags].
    merged := Array new: 0.
    ex do: [:tag |
      (merged includes: tag) ifFalse: [merged := merged copyWith: tag]
    ].
    nw do: [:tag |
      (merged includes: tag) ifFalse: [merged := merged copyWith: tag]
    ].
    ^merged
  ]
